xv6 WASM profiles
=================

The `.cpuprofile` files are V8 CPU profiles. Open Chrome or Chromium
DevTools, select **Performance**, choose **Load profile**, and select either
`tinyemu.cpuprofile` or `riscbox.cpuprofile`.

For a standalone flame graph, run:

    npx speedscope tinyemu.cpuprofile
    npx speedscope riscbox.cpuprofile

Inspect the guest output with:

    less tinyemu.log
    less riscbox.log
    rg 'XV6_PROFILE_BUILD_COMPLETE|poweroff|Power off' *.log

To summarize the profile sizes and sample counts:

    node -e 'for (const f of process.argv.slice(1)) { const p = require(`./${f}`); console.log(f, `nodes=${p.nodes.length}`, `samples=${p.samples.length}`); }' *.cpuprofile
